Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"print a hold slip and fold it into the item so the\\nname is visible from the spine\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Matches the procedure described.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Shelve items alphabetically by the borrower's\\nsurname.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Bring your library card.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"DERIVED\",\"evidence\":\"Day one is the day the borrower is notified, not the day the item arrived.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Combines source_a's 'day one is the day the borrower is notified' with source_b's 'We will email you when it is ready to collect' to entail that day one is the emailing day.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Day one is the day the borrower is notified, not the day the item arrived.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Sweep the shelf every morning before opening.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Items past 7 days go back into\\ncirculation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Items past 7 days go back into\\ncirculation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A borrower who asks before the 7 days are up can have the item held for a further\\n7 days.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"This is granted once per request.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back\\nto the shelves and the request is cancelled.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back\\nto the shelves and the request is cancelled.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the reservation is\\ncancelled and you will need to reserve it again.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states this.\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":9922,"type":"result","duration_ms":18366,"uuid":"90856463-7213-49a6-9fd0-5cd5ced1e037","ttft_stream_ms":2342,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":2343,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
